.TH "intel_stepping" "1" "2016-03-01" "igt-gpu-tools 2.5" "General Commands Manual"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
intel_stepping \- Display the stepping information for an Intel GPU
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBintel_stepping\fP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBintel_stepping\fP is a tool to print the stepping information for an Intel GPU,
along with the PCI ID and revision used to determine it. It requires root
privilege to map the graphics device.
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.sp
Not all the known stepping IDs or chipsets are included, so the output on some
devices may not be as specific as possible.
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.sp
Report bugs on fd.o GitLab: \%<https://\:gitlab\:.freedesktop\:.org/\:drm/\:igt-gpu-tools/\:-/\:issues>
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
IGT Developers <igt-dev@lists.freedesktop.org>
